\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 8500008 (AMR-084-0008). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Andrej Dujella, Diophantine m-tuples, author-maintained survey (snapshot accessed 9 October 2026), Section 5.3, Rational D(q)-m-tuples. \url{https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dujella/dujella.github.io/master/ratio.html}.
